       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Manufacturers who use shrink tools will find the most modern shrinking machines currently available at ZOLLER. We have developed completely new technological solutions for basic shrinking sub-processes. The gains in energy efficiency, process speed and process control are outstanding.</strong></p> <p>Low time expenditure, high efficiency and gentle on shrink fit chucks - the ZOLLER devices for shrinking in and shrinking on shank tools achieve top values in all relevant areas with innovative technology. <br/><br/>We have 2-in-1 solutions for production facilities that not only want to shrink tools, but also set and measure them. They combine length-accurate shrinking with the exact geometry data from ZOLLER's high-precision presetting and measuring machines.</p> <p>Great technology for great results.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/products/shrink-technology\">Show products</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c697",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
   "id": "c695",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Simply follow the light </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Ergonomics, safety and simple operation have always been a high priority at ZOLLER. This is reflected in the shrink units by three LED-based control systems. These guide you safely through the shrinking process, inform you about the status of the coils and show you when cooling is complete.</p> <p>They are called »actbyLight«, »shrinkbyLight« and »coolbyLight«. Exclusively from ZOLLER. </p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c698",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Extreme efficiency </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">With the induction system developed by ZOLLER, you can be sure of a high efficiency of almost 100 %. Two parallel windings are installed in the coils. Almost the entire electrical power input flows into heating the shrink fit chucks.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">In addition, each heating and cooling cycle is extremely fast. Extreme efficiency for your shrinking processes. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/d/csm_shrinking_01_e63ec03bf9.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c700",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Valuable tool data </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Data plays a key role in the ZOLLER system. Tool data that can be used for tool management is also generated in shrinking processes. For all tools with a ZOLLER »idChip«, you can automatically record heating cycles and have them saved by the »pilot 4.0« software. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/0/csm_shrinking_02_d3c241dbbc.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c699",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "none",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Productive premium quality </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">With ZOLLER shrinking machines, you benefit from the latest technology and proven quality designed for durability. All devices integrate immediately into your production and support productivity.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">The »powerShrink series« and the »redomatic 400« and »redomatic 600« devices are TÜV and UL/CSA approved. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/2/csm_shrinking_03_2905d02cf7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
